{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45391","headline":"陈氏童子草书歌 · 皎然","name":"陈氏童子草书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书家孺子有奇名，天然大草令人惊。\n僧虔老时把笔法，孺子如今皆暗合。\n飙挥电洒眼不及，但觉毫端鸣飒飒。\n有时作点险且能，太行片石看欲崩。\n偶然长掣浓入燥，少室枯松欹不倒。\n夏室炎炎少人欢，山轩日色在阑干。\n桐花飞尽子规思，主人高歌兴不至。\n浊醪不饮嫌昏沈，欲翫草书开我襟。\n龙爪状奇鼠须锐，水牋白皙越人惠。\n王家小令草最狂，爲予洒出惊腾势。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}